Subject: mt7996: align AP selection and 5 GHz near/far TXOP with retail

Reconstruct the host near/far rule independently from XR1710G retail
5.1.1.12 MacTableMaintenance and vow_variable_reset. Select current BSS
by last WCID and spot AP by first WCID, independently of iterator order.
Main traffic statistics retain first-WCID tie breaking. Unknown PHY rate
is not classified as a slow station. This is not a full WM/WA port.

